<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>
<body>

<%- include('partials/header', { page: page }) %>

<section class="section alt" id="services">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="kicker">What we build</div>
    <h2>Four systems, one workshop.</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">From a single residential door to a full commercial facade — designed, fabricated, and installed under one roof.</p>

    <div class="services-grid">
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="photo-frame service-photo"><img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/7638806/pexels-photo-7638806.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=700" alt="Contemporary glass and metal double doors"></div>
        <div class="service-body">
          <h3>Doors</h3>
          <p>Durable, secure aluminium doors for residential and commercial entries, sliding or hinged.</p>
          <div class="service-spec">SPEC — powder-coat / multi-point lock</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="photo-frame service-photo"><img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/30728904/pexels-photo-30728904.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=700" alt="Minimalist wall with aluminium shutters"></div>
        <div class="service-body">
          <h3>Windows</h3>
          <p>Aluminium and glass windows built for energy efficiency, comfort, and a clean sightline.</p>
          <div class="service-spec">SPEC — Low-E / thermal break</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="photo-frame service-photo"><img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/7078620/pexels-photo-7078620.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=700" alt="Glass facade of an office building"></div>
        <div class="service-body">
          <h3>Glass</h3>
          <p>Tempered, laminated, and UV-protected glass for partitions, facades, and decorative work.</p>
          <div class="service-spec">SPEC — tempered / laminated / etched</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="photo-frame service-photo"><img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/18356512/pexels-photo-18356512.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=700" alt="Modern office building windows grid pattern"></div>
        <div class="service-body">
          <h3>Curtain Walls</h3>
          <p>Structural curtain-wall systems for commercial towers, engineered for load and wind.</p>
          <div class="service-spec">SPEC — unitized / stick-built</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<!-- ============ MATERIALS & FINISHES ============ -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="kicker">Materials & finishes</div>
    <h2>Specify the finish, not just the frame.</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">Every system is available across a standard range of coatings and glazing — custom colours and glass builds are quoted on request.</p>
    <div class="material-grid">
      <div class="material-cell"><div class="material-swatch" style="background:#3C4547;"></div><h3>Matte Graphite</h3><p>Powder-coat, RAL 7024-family, low-glare finish.</p></div>
      <div class="material-cell"><div class="material-swatch" style="background:#D9D3C6;"></div><h3>Warm Sand</h3><p>Powder-coat, RAL 1015-family, popular for residential.</p></div>
      <div class="material-cell"><div class="material-swatch" style="background:#5B6567;"></div><h3>Anodized Silver</h3><p>Anodized finish for high-traffic commercial entries.</p></div>
      <div class="material-cell"><div class="material-swatch" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#AEC7C2,#7FCBA6);"></div><h3>Low-E Glazing</h3><p>Solar-control coated glass for heat and glare reduction.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="section dark">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="kicker">Built for local conditions</div>
    <h2>Engineered for Pakistan's climate, not a European catalogue.</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">Islamabad summers, dust storms, and monsoon humidity ask more of a window than a mild-climate spec sheet does. Every system we build accounts for it.</p>
    <div class="climate-grid">
      <div class="climate-cell">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><path d="M12 2v3M12 19v3M4.2 4.2l2.1 2.1M17.7 17.7l2.1 2.1M2 12h3M19 12h3M4.2 19.8l2.1-2.1M17.7 6.3l2.1-2.1"/></svg>
        <h3>Heat &amp; UV resistance</h3>
        <p>Low-E and tinted glazing options that cut solar heat gain through peak summer.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="climate-cell">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M3 15c2-3 4-3 6 0s4 3 6 0 4-3 6 0M3 20c2-3 4-3 6 0s4 3 6 0 4-3 6 0"/></svg>
        <h3>Dust &amp; sand sealing</h3>
        <p>Tight-tolerance gaskets that keep dust storms out of tracks and hardware.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="climate-cell">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M12 3v9M8 8l4-5 4 5M5 21h14M7 17l1-4h8l1 4"/></svg>
        <h3>Monsoon-ready seals</h3>
        <p>Drainage-engineered frames that shed heavy rain instead of pooling it.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="climate-cell">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><rect x="4" y="10" width="16" height="10" rx="1"/><path d="M8 10V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3"/></svg>
        <h3>Security hardware</h3>
        <p>Multi-point locking on doors and windows as standard, not an upsell.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="kicker" style="margin-top:52px;">Where we work</div>
    <div class="cities-row">
      <span class="city-chip">Islamabad</span>
      <span class="city-chip">Rawalpindi</span>
      <span class="city-chip">DHA &amp; Bahria Town</span>
      <span class="city-chip">Lahore</span>
      <span class="city-chip">Karachi (on request)</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<!-- ============ ORDERING PROCESS ============ -->
<section class="section alt">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="kicker">How to order</div>
    <h2>From enquiry to installed, in four steps.</h2>
    <div class="process-row">
      <div class="process-step"><div class="step-num">01</div><h3>Send dimensions</h3><p>Share rough measurements or drawings on WhatsApp or the contact form.</p></div>
      <div class="process-step"><div class="step-num">02</div><h3>Get a real quote</h3><p>We come back with pricing based on your actual site, not a placeholder rate.</p></div>
      <div class="process-step"><div class="step-num">03</div><h3>Confirm & fabricate</h3><p>Once confirmed, your system is fabricated in-house to the agreed spec.</p></div>
      <div class="process-step"><div class="step-num">04</div><h3>Install & handover</h3><p>Our own crews install and walk you through the finished system.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<!-- ============ FAQ ============ -->
<section class="section dark">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="kicker">Service questions</div>
    <h2>What people ask before ordering.</h2>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <details class="faq-item"><summary>Can you match an existing frame colour?</summary><p>In most cases, yes — bring a sample or RAL code and we'll confirm during the consultation.</p></details>
      <details class="faq-item"><summary>Do you supply glass only, without frames?</summary><p>Yes, tempered and laminated glass can be supplied and cut to size independently of a frame order.</p></details>
      <details class="faq-item"><summary>Is site measurement included in the quote?</summary><p>For commercial and larger residential jobs, yes. Small standard-size orders can sometimes be quoted from dimensions alone.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<%- include('partials/footer') %>

<%- include('partials/fab') %>

<script src="/js/script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
